orthant 1 release

- - The changes since the last release accumulate in `doc/migration/<version>.md`, named from
-   the start after the release they will be part of (for example `doc/migration/0.71.0.md`
+ - The changes since the last release accumulate in `doc/work/migration/<version>.md`, named from
+   the start after the release they will be part of (for example `doc/work/migration/0.71.0.md`

- `doc/migration/<v>.md` with `A < v <= B`, in ascending version order, and to apply the changes
+ `doc/work/migration/<v>.md` with `A < v <= B`, in ascending version order, and to apply the changes
